    <briefdescription>
<para>Shared implementation of use-lists for replaceable metadata. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Most metadata cannot be RAUW&apos;ed. This is a shared implementation of use-lists and associated API for the three that support it ( <emphasis><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_value_as_metadata" kindref="compound">ValueAsMetadata</ref></emphasis>, <emphasis>TempMDNode</emphasis>, and <emphasis><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_d_i_arg_list" kindref="compound">DIArgList</ref></emphasis>). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
